    "text": "I, Karunathilaka Ralahamilage Wasundara Erandi Dissanayake, Returning Officer of the Galigamuwa Pradeshiya Sabha, do hereby declare under Section 10A(1)(a) of the (Chapter 262) Local Authorities Elections Ordinance that Mr. Godayalage Lalith Rohana Pieris of the Galigamuwa Pradeshiya Sabha has vacated his office of member of that Pradeshiya Sabha as he has been ceased to be a member of the Sarvajana Balaya.",
